[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9603.75, "timestamp": "02:40:03", "text": "们太忙了，我请求开个会，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9606.79, "timestamp": "02:40:06", "text": "复查一下情况，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9610.55, "timestamp": "02:40:10", "text": "呃，了解一下[音乐]之类的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9613.349, "timestamp": "02:40:13", "text": "他们甚至都做不到，我的意思是，是的，即使到了今天我们也做不到，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9624.55, "timestamp": "02:40:24", "text": "我不知道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9630.95, "timestamp": "02:40:30", "text": "现在唯一的问题就是律师的事，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9634.23, "timestamp": "02:40:34", "text": "我就像[音乐]该死，好吧，我知道我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9637.116, "timestamp": "02:40:37", "text": "有邻居什么的，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9641.429, "timestamp": "02:40:41", "text": "[音乐]嗯，如果，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9644.55, "timestamp": "02:40:44", "text": "我真的急需他们，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9648.469, "timestamp": "02:40:48", "text": "而我实际上真的需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9651.59, "timestamp": "02:40:51", "text": "他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9653.99, "timestamp": "02:40:53", "text": "呃，你知道，如果真的要……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9657.83, "timestamp": "02:40:57", "text": "如果真的……"}]